---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
---
<LegalLayout title="Disclaimer" description="Disclaimer for information, technical content and illustrations published on the Nanofab Innovations website.">
  <p>The information on this website is published by {site.legalName} for general information about our company, products and services.</p>

  <h2>General information only</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep the content accurate and up to date, but we make no representations or warranties, express or implied, about its completeness, accuracy,
    reliability or suitability for any purpose. Any reliance you place on it is at your own risk.
  </p>

  <h2>Not engineering advice</h2>
  <p>
    Blog articles, FAQs, guides and other technical resources are general guidance. They are not engineering, legal or compliance advice for a specific project.
    Designs should always be validated for the intended application, environment and applicable standards. For advice on your project, please
    <a href="/contact">contact our engineering team</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Products, specifications and capabilities</h2>
  <p>
    Product details, specifications and capability figures are provided for guidance, may change without notice, and are confirmed only in a written quotation
    or agreement.
  </p>

  <h2>Illustrations</h2>
  <p>
    Some images, diagrams and interface visuals, such as dashboard screens and circuit graphics, are illustrative and may not represent final products,
    systems or data.
  </p>

  <h2>Case studies and examples</h2>
  <p>
    Case studies describe specific past projects. Results depend on each project's requirements and circumstances and are not a guarantee of similar outcomes.
    Client names are published only with permission.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>Links to third-party websites are provided for convenience. We do not endorse and are not responsible for their content or availability.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>If you notice an error on this website, please let us know through our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
